# Optional voice configuration. The resident agent uses the local Harness login.
# Voice ASR/TTS, independent of the agent Harness. Prefer the signed app's --voice-save-key
# command (stdin only) to store this in macOS Keychain instead of a file.
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=
# Empty uses Qianwen's unified endpoint. For Alibaba regional keys only:
# cn-beijing or ap-southeast-1, optionally with a dedicated workspace ID.
RELAY_VOICE_REGION=
DASHSCOPE_WORKSPACE_ID=
